--------------------------------------------------

Replace the current primarily local/manual decision triggering with a more realistic event-driven trigger policy.

Requirements:
- trigger feature generation from incoming market snapshot events
- trigger decision cycles based on deterministic cadence / gating rules
- avoid duplicated decisions for the same symbol/timeframe when nothing materially changed
- respect staleness / expiry rules
- support current MVP scope:
  - BTC-USDT
  - 15m / 1h

Implementation requirements:
- add a scheduler / trigger policy component if needed
- preserve the existing decision engine responsibilities
- document how decision triggering works

Expected behavior:
- decisions are driven by real market event flow rather than only one-shot local scripts

